==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro}} {{term|surcengle||lang=fro}}, formed with {{term|sur||lang=fr|over}} and {{term|cengle||lang=fro|girdle}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{rfp|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# a long unpadded strap to pass over and keep in place a blanket, pack or [[saddle]] on an animal
# a piece of [[tack]] wrapped around the belly of a horse, to use when [[lunge|longeing]], also know as [[lungeing]]; (roller in UK and Australasia)
# a girdle to fasten a garment, especially a cassock

